        <div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-lime" href="https://joinnorma.com/">Get access now ↗</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/what-we-do/norma">How it fits our work</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="nm-vis">
        <div class="photo nm-dash"><img src="/assets/dash-hero.webp" alt="The nørma leader dashboard" width="1120" height="816" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="nm-phone"><div><img src="/assets/app-where-you-stand.webp" alt="The nørma app: where you stand across the Five Pillars" loading="lazy" /></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- About Ian -->
<section class="bg-sand lift-b">
  <div class="wrap sec split">
    <figure class="photo" style="margin:0;flex:1 1 400px;aspect-ratio:4/5;max-width:520px" data-rv>
      <img src="/assets/ian-presenting.jpg" alt="Ian Williams facilitating a leadership session" width="1024" height="683" loading="lazy" style="object-position:62% 50%" />
    </figure>
    <div style="flex:1 1 460px">
      <span class="eyebrow">About Ian</span>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,44px)">I am Ian Williams. I have spent more than thirty years inside the part of business that does not show up on <span class="mk">the org chart</span>.</h2>
      <p class="lead">I am the founder and CEO of The Artistry of Humanity. I have turned around underperforming businesses and built high-performing cultures, and today I work with leadership teams as a consultant, facilitator and keynote speaker.</p>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li><Icon name="pin" size={20} /><span>Grew up in <b>Liverpool</b></span></li>
        <li><Icon name="users" size={20} /><span>Leading people since <b>17</b></span></li>
        <li><Icon name="chart" size={20} /><span>Led teams at <b>DHL</b></span></li>
        <li><Icon name="globe" size={20} /><span><b>Three continents</b></span></li>
      </ul>
      <figure class="ian-q">
        <blockquote>Human strategy is the conversation I think every leadership team needs to have, and <span class="mk">most are not having yet</span>.</blockquote>
      </figure>
      <div class="accs" style="margin-top:24px">
        <details class="acc">
          <summary>Why I built the Five Pillars</summary>
          <div class="acc-body"><p>The language we were using for wellbeing was not load bearing enough to carry the weight leaders are now carrying. The work is the same in every form: helping leaders see the human side of their business clearly, and giving them a way to actually run it.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
      <a class="link" href="/about">Read my story ›</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Contact -->
<section class="lift" id="contact" style="background:var(--cream);scroll-margin-top:60px">
  <div class="wrap sec">
    <div class="narrow center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Book time with us</span>
      <h2>Start with a free <span class="mk">diagnostic session</span>.</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">Thirty minutes with Ian, direct. In most conversations you will leave with something useful, whether we work together or not.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="split" style="align-items:start;margin-top:clamp(44px,5vw,64px)">
      <div class="card-dark call" data-rv style="flex:1 1 360px">
        <div class="call-hd">
          <img src="/assets/ian-portrait.webp" alt="" width="900" height="802" loading="lazy" />
          <span><span class="pill">Free · 30 minutes · No obligation</span><b>A conversation with Ian, on the house.</b></span>
        </div>
        <ol class="call-steps">
          {CALL.map(c => <li><span class="ico"><Icon name={c.icon} size={20} /></span>{c.t}</li>)}
